!weights/README.md
outputs/
output/
tmp/
*.db
*.sqlite3

# ---- Thesis writing workspace (LaTeX sources + build artefacts, ~121 MB) ----
# Kept outside version control deliberately; the reproducible figure payloads
# that the thesis cites live in artifacts/thesis_showcase/ and ARE tracked.
fixes/

# ---- OS / editor / agent workspaces ----
